WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.220
Team & setup: technicians and their private links, checklists and field-service settings.

2
00:00:07.769 --> 00:00:14.690
Create a "New technician" or bring them in "From scheduling staff"; write their "Skills (comma-separated)".

3
00:00:15.235 --> 00:00:20.950
Send "The technician's private link" to that technician only; they see their jobs through it.

4
00:00:21.499 --> 00:00:28.180
Under "Checklists", create one per service and mark which items need a photo or are required.

5
00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:32.850
When a technician leaves, cancel their link with "New link".
